## Codex

- Skills live in the shared store at `~/.agents/skills/`, which Codex scans natively. A skill carrying
  `policy: allow_implicit_invocation: false` in its `agents/openai.yaml` is on-demand: it loads only
  when invoked as `$name`.
- Slash commands under `~/.claude/commands/` are Claude Code's, so the flows they describe are read and
  followed by hand here.

